WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.933
With Tolgee, each string is
a key with a default value,

2
00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.871
synced to a Tolgee project.

3
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.148
Tolgee does this well,

4
00:00:09.148 --> 00:00:11.655
with self-hosting,
in-context editing,

5
00:00:11.655 --> 00:00:13.233
and AI translation.

6
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:17.156
General Translation keeps
readable copy in components,

7
00:00:17.156 --> 00:00:19.071
and translates it with no keys.

8
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.809
Wrap the heading and
count in a T component,

9
00:00:22.809 --> 00:00:24.178
with the forms in Plural.

10
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:27.598
Adding Swedish takes one
line in the config file.

11
00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:32.957
The next build runs npx gt
translate and writes every Swedish

12
00:00:32.957 --> 00:00:33.443
form.

13
00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.726
Your team now ships
Swedish with each release.
